# Cloudflare Realtime — TURN + Serverless SFU + MoQ Relay

## Overview

Three Cloudflare Realtime services replace Zoom, Twilio Media Streams, and third-party WebRTC infrastructure with zero-cost, globally distributed media routing.

| Service | Purpose | Free Tier |
|---|---|---|
| **TURN Server** | NAT traversal relay for peers behind firewalls | 1 TB/month |
| **Serverless SFU** | Multi-party audio/video track routing (no transcoding) | Unlimited sessions |
| **MoQ Relay** | Publish/subscribe live media over QUIC — one publish, infinite subscribers | 302 global edge locations |

