## Audio Capture for AI Processing

The SFU handles media routing, but Little Nate still needs audio for:
- Voice biometric extraction (pitch, energy, speech rate)
- Nevedal C_emo computation
- Coaching card generation
- Wisdom extraction from sessions

Pattern: Client captures audio via `MediaStream` → `AudioContext` → extracts PCM samples → sends to bridge via existing WebSocket alongside the SFU media path. The SFU carries the real-time audio between peers; the WebSocket carries the AI analysis stream to the backend.

